#: scenario3:scenario3_9521FB25_384A_47B1_8307_A477AB4052A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2be63763c424b2a92d33b1c779b3e7f619a900de970aa77fe9631ee714b75fae
